      -m, --model        Video model for spec (default: kling-v3-standard)
      --batch-id         Custom batch ID (auto-generated if omitted)

  animated <batch_id>    Generate animated videos from scene specs
    Options:
      -w, --workers      Max parallel workers (default: 5)
      -m, --model        Video model override (kling-v3-standard, veo3.1, sora2-pro, etc.)
