  visualize <script>     Generate visual brief for editors (post-avatar)
    Arguments:
      script               Script file path
    Options:
      --batch <id>         Visualize all scripts in a batch
      --product <code>     Product code override

  avatar <batch_id>      Generate avatar videos (WW-2 -> WW-Ralph bridge)
    Options:
      --run                Generate config AND run avatar_batch.py
