    forced-rank all combinations with reasoning, flags components to SCALE vs REWRITE.

  preflight <batch_id>   Pre-flight checklist - verify everything before generation
    Options:
      --upload             Also check Google Drive + ClickUp readiness
      --meta               Also check META upload readiness
      --all                Check everything (generate + upload + META)
      --test               Test live connections (ClickUp API, etc.)

  dashboard              Open pipeline dashboard (visual Kanban board)
    Options:
      --port N             Port number (default: 8420)

  scan                   Scan META Ad Library pages for new creatives
    Options:
      --no-analyze       Scan only, skip Gemini analysis
      --video            Enable video analysis (slower, downloads videos)
      --max-videos N     Max videos to analyze per page (default: 3)
      --page <id|label>  Scan a single page
      --stats            Show database overview stats
      --winners          Show long-running ads (probable winners)
      --new-today        Show ads first seen today
      --killed           Show ads killed fast (failed tests)
      --min-days N       Min days for --winners (default: 14)
      --migrate          One-time: import existing JSON scans into SQLite

  research               Scrape Reddit → corpus file → Opus 1M Q&A loop (cached)
    Options:
      --topic TEXT       Research topic (required unless --corpus given)
      --product CODE     Product code, routes corpus to products/CODE/research/corpus/
      --corpus PATH      Skip scraping, load existing corpus file and open Q&A
      --max-threads N    Max threads kept after filter (default: 80)
      --scrape-only      Build corpus and exit, no Q&A
      --dry-run          Show queries + filter counts only

  validate <script>      Validate a generated script
    Options:
      -t, --task-id      Task ID (extracted from filename if not provided)
      -q, --quiet        Only output pass/fail

  simulate <batch|script> Synthetic audience pre-test (archetype reactions)
    Arguments:
      target               Batch ID or script file path
    Options:
      -p, --product        Product code (auto-detected for batches)
      -c, --concept "..."  Test raw concept text (no script needed)
      -a, --archetypes     Comma-separated archetypes (default: all)
      -w, --workers        Parallel API calls (default: 8)
      --json               Output raw JSON instead of formatted report

  learn "<rule>"         Add a quality gate from a human correction
    - Creates a bead to track the correction
    - Appends rule to Quality Gates section in AGENTS.md
    - Next generation run picks it up automatically

  hire <subcommand>      Upwork hiring automation
    Subcommands:
      auth                 Run OAuth2 flow, store tokens
      post [--dry-run]     Create DR video editor job posting
      search [options]     Search freelancers (--skills, --rate-max, --jss-min, --country, --top-rated)
